<title>USA: U.S. Boxed Beef cut-out at 1500 CST - USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. Boxed Beef cut-out at 1500 CST - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Boxed beef steady to firm on light to moderate demand and offerings. Select and Choice middle meats generally steady, while chuck and round cuts mostly firm.</p>
<p>Beef trimmings not established. - USDA</p>
